+The outbound half of the place work, beside the inbound place lane in
+``tests/test_telegram_places.py`` (whose ``env`` fixture it shares: the real Host Service app, a
+connected Telegram place, the recorded Telegram wire). Events come from the real ``LocalChatBridge``
+emitters through the real event bus to the skill's real handlers; nothing is hand-built that the
+host would publish itself.
